        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-08T13:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>He is not a mechanic yet, so he should have something like \"Power : Strike. Destroy one of your equipment cards. If at least one card was destroyed this way, Mr Fixer deals two targets 2 melee damage, else he does one target 2 melee damage\".</p><p>This way, the tools have no effects except as \"fuel\" (most of the time). Let's give him a few HP to compensate the loss of his damage reduction tool.</p>",
