        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/defeateddust/{size}/2245_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-08T14:31:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TheSoundOfTrees\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TheSoundOfTrees:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>He is not a mechanic yet, so he should have something like \"Power : Strike. Destroy one of your equipment cards. If at least one card was destroyed this way, Mr Fixer deals two targets 2 melee damage, else he does one target 2 melee damage\".This way, the tools have no effects except as \"fuel\" (most of the time). Let's give him a few HP to compensate the loss of his damage reduction tool.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That is kind of similar to th Darkwatch Mr Fixer why not something along the lines of \"Power: 'Union Strike' Mr Fixer deals 1 target 1 melee damage, return 1 hero card back to the heros hand. Mr Fixer deals a second target 1 melee damage.\"</p>",
