        "created_at": "2015-01-08T16:39:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have suggested the following for Union Strike when it was first mentioned. (If this isn't exactly what I said the first time, it's what I decided it should be after a little more reflection.)</p><p>Power: Black Fist Mr. Fixer does one target 1 melee damage. Until the start of your turn, increase the first damage dealt to that target each turn by 1.</p>",
